petrus-posix
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package supports the Haskell port of Petrus (see UPSTREAM.md at the
repository root). It reproduces the POSIX behaviour the pinned reference
gets from CPython 3.14 (fcntl.flock, os calls with dir_fd, pathlib's resolve
and expanduser, os.path.realpath, the atomic-replace pattern, getrusage and
sysconf figures), and its test suite checks it against Python.

